    "type": "tv",
    "description": "<p><b>Southern Charm</b> goes behind the walls of Charleston, South Carolina's most aristocratic families to reveal a world of exclusivity, money and scandal that goes back generations. The fast-paced, drama-filled docu-series follows six Charleston singles — Craig Conover, Cameran Eubanks, Jenna King, Thomas Ravenel, Shepard \"Shep\" Rose, and Whitney Sudler Smith — struggling with the constraints of this tight-knit, posh society. The cast, some descendants of Vice Presidents and four-term Senators, and others from \"new money,\" is comprised of Southern bachelors who suffer from \"Peter Pan Syndrome\" by refusing to settle down; and the women in their lives who challenge them to grow up. Viewers will see them launch political careers, build businesses, break hearts, and chase true love -- all while struggling to preserve their family names. Because in Charleston, you're only as good as your last garden party and one social screw-up can taint generations to come.</p>",
    "title": "Southern Charm",
    "episode": {
      "description": "<p>After rushing to Salley's defense at the garden party, Madison hosts a gathering where Venita reveals a secret. Allie starts to second guess her upcoming date with Whitner after speaking to the girls. Craig and Whitner attempt to make amends.</p>",
